  "description": "Out-of-process HTTP capture for Kronikol: a transparent tee proxy that sits on a service-to-service hop, forwards byte-for-byte, attributes each exchange to the running test via the test-tracking headers (or the W3C trace id), re-injects the correlation headers across non-cooperating hops, redacts secrets at capture, and writes to the Kronikol log store and/or an NDJSON file for `kronikol ingest`. Enables sequence diagrams for polyglot, third-party or legacy backends that cannot be instrumented.",
